  "description": "Top star Kang Beom thinks he has it all until an unknown drink in his idol dressing room knocks him out completely. When he regains consciousness, he finds himself helpless and at the mercy of Song Ui-geon, an enigmatic and sinister figure. Ui-geon uses the horrifying encounter as leverage, forcing the prickly idol into an absolute submission pact filled with increasingly outrageous orders. Caught in a web of coercion, Beom tries to hold onto his pride and career while trapped under Ui-geon's complete control. Now, the top idol must decide how far he will go to survive his captor's twisted demands. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
